      "message": "Are you sure we should be toggling just fw_wp instead of fw_wp_state?\n\nIt looks like we are using fw_wp_state in tast tests:\n\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/tast-tests/src/chromiumos/tast/remote/servo/methods.go;l\u003d496;drc\u003de807ff1de82af5de4c468560a8f4ba6054ced8a4",
